| Criterion | Requirement / decision / risk / task | Method and observation | State and limits |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| AC-01 | REQ-01 / D-01 / R-01 / T001 | Source/local inventory; byte comparisons rejected duplicate-log deletion; empty placeholder removed | APPROVED; historical/unique data preserved |
