| AC-04 | REQ-04 / D-04 / R-04 / T004 | 23 filesystem/lifecycle fixtures; six independent succession tests | APPROVED within cooperative process boundary |
| AC-05 | REQ-05 / D-05 / R-05 / T005 | Broad regression plus affected-case rechecks, 23 final collector cases and three clean native static scans | APPROVED; one opt-in full scanner test not enabled, no product acceptance |

All adopted maintenance criteria are supported within the recorded boundary.
Task closure/documentation review and current content bindings are in evidence.json;
raw failures and successful rechecks remain in the report. Revisit pinned legacy
